(271,9,12400,23840,'So what\'s new mark how is your new job going to be honest i can\'t complain i really love the company that i am',NULL,1),
(272,9,23840,34000,'Working for my co-workers are all really friendly and helpful they really help me feel welcome',NULL,2),
(273,9,34000,43600,'It\'s a really energetic and fun atmosphere my boss is hilarious and he\'s really flexible',NULL,3),
(274,9,43600,55520,'Really how so he allows me to come in when i want and make my own hours i can also leave early',NULL,4),
(275,9,55520,64879,'If i start early there is no real dress code either i can wear jeans and a t-shirt if i want',NULL,5),
(276,9,64879,76479,'I can even wear shorts in the summer wow it sounds really cool i can\'t stand wearing a suit every day',NULL,6),
(277,9,76479,87439,'Which do you prefer working late or finishing early i prefer finishing early i really enjoy the morning',NULL,7),
(278,9,87439,97680,'I love getting up early and going for a run there\'s nothing like watching the sunrise while drinking my morning coffee',NULL,8),
(279,9,97680,108000,'Really i am opposite i love sleeping in i am most alert in the evenings',NULL,9),
